# Line endings are declared here so they do not depend on each contributor's
# core.autocrlf setting. Every file in this repository is stored with LF, and
# is checked out with LF: Visual Studio, MSBuild and the Crestron SDK all read
# LF happily on Windows, and pinning it stops Git from rewriting files on
# checkout (the "this file uses LF but Git is configured to convert them to
# CRLF" notice in GitHub Desktop) and stops the working tree drifting into a
# mix of both.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touch these, should any ever be committed: rewriting a byte of a
# driver package or an assembly corrupts it.
*.pkg binary
*.dat binary
*.dll binary
*.exe binary
*.zip binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
